   "pools": "PRIMARY = archived records (data/hamiltonian/raw) + the production plan records; DIAGNOSTIC = the M4d extraction-check plan records. M5 selects from PRIMARY only; DIAGNOSTIC records enter only epsilon_grid on their overlap and are reported alongside (they never enter M6/M7, and never enter epsilon_cross, which feeds epsilon_spec).",
